<ul>
	<li><b>Photo</b> (<code>im-poster-photo</code>) — the picture is the post. A word only if it adds something the photo cannot say.</li>
	<li><b>Word</b> (<code>im-poster-wordpost</code>) — a thought, a rule, a reminder. Two lines and a hand note. If it needs three lines, it is a carousel.</li>
	<li><b>Quote</b> (<code>im-poster-quote</code>) — someone else's words, credited in the chip. Your own words are a Word post, not a quote.</li>
	<li><b>Collage</b> (<code>im-poster-collage</code>) — four photos taped down, one sticker. For "a week of…", a meal, a trip day.</li>
</ul>

