<p>A story is gone in a day, so it can be looser: a sticker can sit at an angle, a hand note can say "honest question". Two rules still hold. <b>The top and bottom two rows are not yours</b> — the app draws the profile, the reply bar and the buttons there (the dashed box is what stays clear). And <b>a reel cover is cropped to the middle</b> on the profile grid, so its word lives in the centre band, never near an edge.</p>

<h2 id="profile">Profile and highlights</h2>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-cluster">
